+	/// uses 0.001 on its depth f(z − n)/(z(f − n)) with n = 20 and f = 800 (World camera), which is
+	/// affine in 1/z with the slope f·n/(f − n); 0.001 there is a step of 0.001·(f − n)/(f·n) in
